WEBVTT

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:35.900
<i>Our plan to surprise Aoi-san with a view 
of Mt. Fuji was a wonderful success!</i>

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.870
<i>At least, I think it was a success, probably.</i>

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:44.510
<i>Next, we will be heading up to 
the summit of Mt. Mitsutouge.</i>

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.910
<i>Just a little further to the top!</i>

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:47.870
Mountain Trail

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.790
Season 2 - New Climb 4

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.920
Season 2 - New Climb 4
The Fun After the Climb

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.000
Th-This is...

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:55.550
Incredible!

00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:00.110
That's the sheer cliff. Mitsutouge 
is also a rock-climbing spot.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.540
Wanna try it, Aoi-chan?

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.580
We all practiced it together earlier.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.720
This is completely different from bouldering!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:09.900
I'll pass.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.090
You sure?

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.900
Well, then the summit is 
just past the sheer cliff.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.110
So I see.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.670
It's the last spot!

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:18.780
Yeah!

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:23.660
Now that the scenery's opened 
up, it goes by in a flash.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:26.540
<i>Walk. Walk.</i>

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.710
<i>Walk. Walk.</i>

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.700
<i>A little bit further, another step ahead...</i>

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.710
<i>I can see the summit ahead.</i>

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.100
<i>Just a little further.</i>

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:40.300
<i>A little further, almost there...</i>

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.220
Mitsutouge

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.770
<i>I made it!</i>

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.210
<i>And on my own two feet.</i>

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.090
<i>What a feeling!</i>

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.790
<i>The air tastes so fresh!</i>

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.860
<i>So this... this is...</i>

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:00.870
<i>Mountain climbing!</i>

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.470
Hinata! Kaede-san, Kokona-chan!

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.460
Isn't it amazing?! The view's incredible!

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:11.860
What is it?!

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:15.290
Oh, it's just that I've never 
seen you so excited before, Aoi!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.150
<i>Really?</i>

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.620
<i>Was I smiling just now...?</i>

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.920
<i>Then that means, I'm having fun!</i>

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:40.090
Aoi, your food.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.550
Oh, right.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.530
Eat up, you need to replenish your energy.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.140
It's important.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.040
There'll be lots of walking on the trip back!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.890
<i>That's true.</i>

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.900
<i>I'd better eat my fill!</i>

00:03:56.130 --> 00:04:01.320
Mt. Mitsutouge
1786 m above sea level

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.370
Okay, we're off!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.680
Yeah!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.680
Yes!

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.970
<i>The fun time is over.</i>

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.920
<i>Every beginning has an ending.</i>

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.730
<i>When you climb up, you have to go back down.</i>

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:20.590
<i>I'm a little sad about that.</i>

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:21.360
<i>But...</i>

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:25.070
<i>I'd like to experience that feeling again.</i>

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.770
I see...

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:33.750
When you're descending, you lengthen 
them a bit and adjust your grip.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.070
Let's zip on down!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.630
At the bottom, there's a hot springs!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:40.730
A hot springs?!

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:41.760
Is there really?!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.180
Hot Bath

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.210
There was a signboard when we arrived.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.180
Did you miss it?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.500
Oh, it's true!

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.690
There's a hot springs near the station!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:54.180
Soaking in a bath before heading home 
is one of the joys of mountain climbing!

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.860
Right!

00:04:56.990 --> 00:05:00.190
Hot springs! Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:05.150
Hot springs! Hot springs! 
Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:05.150
<i>A hot springs... we'll all 
be bathing together...</i>

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.950
Hot springs! Hot springs!

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.950
<i>I-I'm so embarrassed!</i>

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.580
Yukimuri-san, are you 
coming to the hot springs?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.890
It's an open-air bath.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.440
Oh, I'm fine, so...

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.600
"Fine"?

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.210
What is?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.540
H-Have a nice bath...

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.800
<i>During my middle school class trip,</i>

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.850
<i>I snuck into the bath after 
everyone else was asleep!</i>

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.100
<i>What'll I do?</i>

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:36.450
You all right?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.470
The descent can be scary. 
It's awfully easy to lose footing.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.980
Yeah.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.310
<i>This is no time to be 
worrying about hot springs.</i>

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.490
<i>I have to focus on the descent.</i>

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.990
Kaede-san, how do you 
walk when climbing down?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:56.420
When descending, experience is 
more important than strength.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.750
It's better to go with the 
flow and descend smoothly.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.020
Like this!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.990
Nice and smooth!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.510
That's too fast!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.510
No way!

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:09.010
I guess I'll just have to walk carefully.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.940
I thought the descent would be easy!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.270
<i>This is where I got scared coming up.</i>

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:25.150
<i>It's no big deal now, maybe 
because I crossed it before?</i>

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:30.150
<i>I was so scared at the time, but 
for some reason, it makes me happy.</i>

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:40.580
<i>My legs are exhausted.</i>

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.500
<i>Why aren't there any benches?</i>

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:45.500
<i>I wanna rest on a bench!</i>

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.220
What?! My knees hurt!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.350
They're killing me!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.460
Kokona-chan, are your knees okay?

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.550
They hurt.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:03.190
Your legs take a lot of strain.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.950
Be careful.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.950
Times that seem easy are when 
you're most likely to get hurt.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:12.490
That moment of relief after clearing 
a tough spot can be dangerous!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.620
R-Right!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.860
<i>I see, I need to concentrate properly.</i>

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:17.820
<i>But...</i>

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.450
<i>My knees ache!</i>

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.190
Are you all right, Hinata-san?

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.130
I'm fine!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.000
I've got knee supports!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.040
Since when?!

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.790
Cheap ones are fine, so it's 
easy to keep some on hand.

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.880
Makes life much easier!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.930
Tell me these things <i>before</i> the climb!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:38.470
<i>How much farther do we have to walk?</i>

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.800
<i>Hurry up... Hurry up, I want it over!</i>

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.020
Aoi-san!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.980
I missed this when we were climbing up...

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.990
Watch Out 
For Bears!

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.990
Bears?!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:54.820
Watch Out For Bears!

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.820
At this point, I don't care about them...

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.550
Okay...

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:58.830
Maybe again someday, Mr. Bear.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.370
Just a bit further!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.880
We've cleared the mountain trail!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.440
Yay!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:08.880
But...

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:12.840
We still have a long ways 
to walk to the station!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:18.060
<i>I said on the way up that paved 
roads were a piece of cake,</i>

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.470
<i>so why is the way back so hard?</i>

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.730
<i>I'm all sweaty.</i>

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.710
<i>I'm dirty from when I tripped.</i>

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:27.060
<i>I feel icky.</i>

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.740
<i>A hot springs, huh...</i>

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.400
Bashfulness

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.570
Hot Springs

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.990
<i>Hot Springs...</i>

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.570
<i>Hot Springs...</i>

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.800
<i>That sounds nice... I wanna 
get into the hot springs!</i>

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.370
Look, everyone!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.620
It's the hot springs!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.540
Hot springs!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.090
Hot springs!!!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.460
Wait!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.210
Hot sprinnngs...

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.010
Women's Bath

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.010
Such nice hot water.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.680
It feels great!

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.300
What bliss.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.380
Ow, my legs.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:01.310
Ow!

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.100
Ow, ow!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.100
Hot springs...

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.660
Hot springs...

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.360
Hot springs...

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.960
You can't come in wearing a towel.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:17.160
And you need to wash up 
first before getting in!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.450
Hot springs!

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.140
Hot springs!

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.220
I've come back to life...

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.890
This is great...

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.040
<i>Now that I'm feeling better, 
I'm embarrassed again!</i>

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:54.530
Wow, Kaede-san, you've got a large chest!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:58.380
Having a big chest really isn't that great.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.280
They get in the way during sports, 
they look fat, and they're heavy.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.450
Okay...

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.290
<i>I can't do this...</i>

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.080
Aoi!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.720
Come over here!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.960
Talk with us!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.590
I'm fine over here!

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.970
You're embarrassed, aren't you?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.040
Wha?!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.640
I am not!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.440
<i>That's why I'm no good with baths.</i>

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.810
I did a bunch of walking today, so...

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.780
Weight

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.550
Watch Out For Bears!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.580
Bears!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:06.270
<i>Thank you for waiting. The holiday express 
Mt. Fuji is now departing for Oyama via Oomiya.</i>

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.140
I'm so glad we could sit down!

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:11.750
We'll take this to Shin-Akitsu,

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.160
then switch to the Seibu Ikebukuro line.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.360
We'll have about two hours on here,

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.610
so let's take it easy.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.280
Oh, look!

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.480
Kaede-san...

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.670
Kokona-chan...

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.420
...and, Hinata...

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.210
thank you very much for today.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.960
You're very welcome!

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.120
It was lots of fun.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:39.900
Yes.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.270
Yeah!

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.480
<i>It was a little tough,</i>

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.310
<i>but a lot of fun.</i>

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:50.440
<i>I want to feel like this again, even more.</i>

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:51.990
<i>And more!</i>

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:56.090
<i>Farewell, Mt. Fuji.</i>

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:57.480
<i>See you later!</i>

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.030
To Be Continued!
